{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17108300","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17108300","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1710830001:1":{"text":"先ほどの横への動き、私が指示せずとも、お前は即座に察したな。","source_cn":"刚才一瞬间的侧身位配合，我并没有下达指令，但你却理解了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E3B4BC7902C23F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710830002:1":{"text":"お父様なら、必ずあの一撃を防いで私に反撃の機会を作ってくださると、信じていましたから。","source_cn":"因为我知道，您一定能挡下那一击，并为我制造出反击的空隙。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B76ED3469CFB927","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710830003:1":{"text":"だから、迷わず矢を射つことができたのです。","source_cn":"我不需要犹豫，只需要把箭射出去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD286B0B05338AA4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710830004:0":{"text":"……今までの私は、お前に危険が及ばないよう、盾で守ることばかり考えていた。","source_cn":"……一直以来，我只想着如何把盾立得更稳，把你严严实实地...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x799FE3774911204B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710830005:1":{"text":"だが、守りは攻撃と組み合わせてこそ盤石になるということを、すっかり忘れていたよ……","source_cn":"却忘了，最好的防守也需要进攻来配合。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F6BEAB5B6176A16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710830006:1":{"text":"私はもう子どもではありません、指揮官。あなたがブライトの盾であるように、私もあなたとこの国を守る矢になりたいのです。","source_cn":"我已经长大了，司令。 就像您是耀光的盾，我也想成为能为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90C0133CA39F242B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1710830007:1":{"text":"攻撃を防ぐ盾は、射手にとって何よりも心強い拠り所です。","source_cn":"盾牌不应该只用来阻挡攻击，而应该成为弓手最坚实的掩体。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFC48B86DD694897","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1710830008:1":{"text":"これからは、守られるのではなく……あなたと共に、戦わせてください。","source_cn":"以前是您守护我，现在……请让我也与您并肩而战。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AE3652B39D0177D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1710830009:1":{"text":"……そうだな。私の背中をお前に預けるぞ、グウィネス隊長。","source_cn":"……我想，我可以把后背交给你了，格温妮丝队长。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x914CF232708C81F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:11:1710830010:1":{"text":"親子としてではなく――指揮官と隊長として。","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD82CA843E419B5AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:12:1710830011:1":{"text":"過度な守りによって生まれた隔たりは、放たれた矢の輝きにそっと溶かされていった……","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C63E6D6AE268B6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:13:1710830012:1":{"text":"そんな父と娘が、戦火の残り火の中で和解を果たしたその時、一方では――","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE01E687D53DAAB28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:亨德里克":{"text":"ヘンドリック","source":"亨德里克","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"グウィネス","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏文本":{"text":"黒画面テキスト","source":"黑屏文本","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":3}}